  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28e94e1714c367a67ad98fbb7b7009ed04362a12\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/28e94e1714c367a67ad98fbb7b7009ed04362a12\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"905\"></div><p>체세포 분열 모형 만드실때 모루 많이 사용하시죠?</p><p>저는 이번에 아폴로를 써 봤어요</p><p>학생들이 과학실험시간에 제일 많이 묻는 말이&#160;</p><p>약품 주면 &quot;이거 먹어도 돼요?&quot;잖아요</p><p>이번엔 &quot;응&quot;이라고 답해주세요</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아폴로36g 한봉지 지마켓 최저가 450원</p><p>한 학생당 한봉지 소요 (색상별 9개)</p><p>색상이 4가지인데 개수는 랜덤이라 여분 몇봉지 더 사용</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92228579ae2d19903938db601d6fc5d55e826e09\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92228579ae2d19903938db601d6fc5d55e826e09\" data-origin-width=\"2896\" data-origin-height=\"2896\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83f7b8f1beab5b06f12c9704678c368ffc9fc3c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/83f7b8f1beab5b06f12c9704678c368ffc9fc3c7\" data-origin-width=\"2768\" data-origin-height=\"1994\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
